NAME
    gcloud alpha agent-identity - manage Agent Identity resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud alpha agent-identity GROUP [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (ALPHA) Manage Agent Identity resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

GROUPS
    GROUP is one of the following:

     access-events
        (ALPHA) Manage Access Event resources.

     connectors
        (ALPHA) Manage Connector resources.

     operations
        (ALPHA) Manage Operation resources.

NOTES
    This command is currently in alpha and might change without notice. If this
    command fails with API permission errors despite specifying the correct
    project, you might be trying to access an API with an invitation-only early
    access allowlist.

